    "description": "Mitsubishi Gas Chemical Company, Inc. manufactures and sells basic and fine chemicals, and functional materials in Japan. It operates through Green Energy & Chemicals Business, Functional Chemicals, and Other segments. The company offers organic synthetic products, paint resin, hydrogen peroxide, ultra-pure hydrogen, polycarbonate resin, printed wiring, methanol, and polycarbonate sheets and films; and manufacture and sell fragrance products, general aromatic chemicals, special aromatic chemicals, foam plastics, and electricity. It also provides inorganic chemicals, engineering plastics, optical materials, and oxygen absorbers, as well as engages in real estate-related activities. In addition, it is engaged organic chemicals, inorganic chemicals, polymer, electronics materials, life sciences products, and other technology/equipment. The company serves coating compounds, agriculture and fertilizers, dyes, perfumes, solvents, optical materials, raw materials for synthetic resins, curing agents, additives, electricity and electrons, food, pharmaceuticals, catalysts, equipment / technology, washing and bleaching, and other sectors. Mitsubishi Gas Chemical Company, Inc. was founded in 1918 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
